        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>We know bringing your child in for an <a href=\"/eye-care-services/comprehensive-eye-exams/\">eye exam</a> can sometimes feel stressful. At Academy Vision, we take a gentle approach that helps kids feel comfortable from the moment they walk in. Whether it’s their first visit or a routine check, we make the experience easy and even a little fun for children in Pine Beach.</p>",
