        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The Importance of Eye Exams for Children",
          "html": "The Importance of Eye Exams for Children",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "h6zh1XPq0J",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Kids don’t always know how to explain what they’re seeing. <a href=\"/eye-care-services/myopia-management/\">Vision problems</a> can go unnoticed, even when they’re affecting learning, focus, and everyday activities. Pediatric eye exams help us catch those issues early, so your child can see clearly and stay on track as they grow.</p>",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "WQOqVt4QNx",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
