        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Common Signs of Vision Problems in Kids",
          "html": "Common Signs of Vision Problems in Kids",
          "id": "yPST3VEsWU",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>If you’ve noticed any of these, it might be time to book an eye exam:</p><ul><li>Squinting or sitting very close to screens or books</li><li>Complaints of headaches or tired eyes</li><li>Trouble focusing or keeping up in school</li><li>Covering one eye or tilting their head</li><li>Frequent eye rubbing or blinking</li><li>Avoiding reading or close-up work</li></ul>",
          "id": "hHrdhU9BCM",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
