          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>We keep your child’s eye exam in Pine Beach simple and tailored to their age. During the visit, we’ll:</p><ul><li>Check how clearly your child can see at different distances</li><li>Evaluate how their eyes work together and focus</li><li>Look at overall eye health and development</li><li>Keep everything age-appropriate and easy to follow</li></ul>",
